    "created_at": "2016-05-10T18:02:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-05-10T18:02:42Z",
    "body": "It's possible there are no servers like that, although if I was implementing a lenient mail server I would probably accept anything@anything. What we'd need in order to change the spec would be a comprehensive survey of all the mail servers on the internet and behind intranets to prove that true, and also two browser vendors willing to make the change (and possibly incur angry users). As such it's probably best to just leave it as-is...\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
